  "chitchat": [
    "\"Everything here keeps you breathing. That’s the whole pitch.\"",
    "\"You touch it, you bought it. Most of it’s already broken, so we’re square.\"",
    "\"Fresh out of the vat? Then you’re fresh out of everything. I can fix one of those.\"",
    "\"Big scores get you killed. A working flashlight gets you home.\"",
    "\"Prices are honest. Out here that counts as a miracle.\"",
    "\"Buy a bandage now or buy a coffin later. I don’t sell coffins.\"",
    "\"Got rods in, and worms to go on ’em. Docks are lousy with fish — and fish don’t shoot back.\""
  ],
  "description": "A broad, unhurried man in a patched vendor’s apron, planted behind a counter of scavenged crates in the cramped front room of his shop. Flashlights and coils of spare cells hang off every nail within reach. He watches the door the way a fisherman watches a net — patient, and already pricing whoever walks through it.",
  "dialogue_tree": {
    "accepted": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "START_QUEST",
          "quest_id": "quest_first_hour"
        },
        {
          "action": "GRANT_ITEM",
          "item_id": "item_bat",
          "quantity": 1
        },
        {
          "action": "EXECUTE_SCRIPT",
          "scriptId": "script_grady_crash_course"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "On it.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Good. There’s a green line on your map now — that’s the way. East, into the alley. Try not to die out there; the paperwork on a fresh clone is murder.\""
    },
    "bye": {
      "options": [],
      "text": "\"Mind the alley. And the sky. And the water. Actually — mind everything.\" He goes back to watching the doors."
    },
    "lore": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Noted.",
          "next": "root"
        }
      ],
      "text": "He taps a scratched flashlight hanging off his belt. \"Two cells. That’s all this old thing ever needed. Everyone out here’s hunting some big score, some perfect gun. Me, I found the one tool that never quit on me and I stopped looking. Learn that before something out there teaches it to you the hard way.\""
    },
    "quest_offer": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I’ll clear them out.",
          "next": "accepted"
        },
        {
          "label": "Not my fight.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Funny you should say it. There’s a crew of clonejackers working the alley just east — Ironside Street. They wait for sprats like you to wobble out of the vats, then lift everything you’ve got before you know you had it. Bad for you. Worse for me: dead customers don’t spend.\" He pulls a battered bat off the crate and holds it out. \"Put two of them down, bring back the cells they boosted off me, and I’ll make it worth your while. Take the loaner. Bring it back or don’t — I’ve a crate of ’em.\""
    },
    "regular": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Show me the crates.",
          "next": "shop"
        },
        {
          "label": "Just passing.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Back for more, regular? Good. You keep breathing, I keep selling. Beautiful arrangement, this.\""
    },
    "reported": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "REMOVE_ITEM",
          "item_id": "item_stolen_cells",
          "quantity": 1
        },
        {
          "action": "TURN_IN",
          "quest_id": "quest_first_hour"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Obliged, Grady.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "He weighs the recovered cells in one hand and, for the first time, actually smiles. \"Well. Look at you — upright AND useful. Rare combination round here.\" He unclips the scratched flashlight from his belt and folds your fingers around it. \"This one’s mine. Was. Never once left me in the dark. Graduation gift. Consider yourself a regular.\""
    },
    "root": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What are you selling?",
          "next": "shop"
        },
        {
          "label": "\"Two-Cell?\"",
          "next": "lore"
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "quest_first_hour",
              "op": "unset",
              "scope": "player"
            }
          ],
          "label": "Something’s hunting the new ones out there.",
          "next": "quest_offer"
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "quest_first_hour",
              "op": "eq",
              "value": "completed",
              "scope": "player"
            }
          ],
          "label": "I put those clonejackers down.",
          "next": "reported"
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "grady_regular",
              "op": "set",
              "scope": "player"
            },
            {
              "flag": "quest_down_the_drain",
              "op": "unset",
              "scope": "player"
            }
          ],
          "label": "Where's a fresh clone earn next?",
          "next": "sewer_offer"
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "quest_down_the_drain",
              "op": "set",
              "scope": "player"
            },
            {
              "flag": "grady_sewer_cleared",
              "op": "unset",
              "scope": "player"
            }
          ],
          "label": "The Under's a little quieter now.",
          "next": "sewer_reported"
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "grady_regular",
              "op": "set",
              "scope": "player"
            }
          ],
          "label": "Good doing business, Grady.",
          "next": "regular"
        },
        {
          "label": "(walk off)",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "The broad man clocks you the instant you’re upright. \"There it is. Another fresh one, blinking in the light.\" He spreads his hands over the crates. \"Name’s Grady. Folks call me Two-Cell. I sell the things that keep you breathing long enough to become a repeat customer.\""
    },
    "sewer_accepted": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "START_QUEST",
          "quest_id": "quest_down_the_drain"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Down I go.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Good. Green line’s on your map — walks you right to the drain. Keep that light charged; I sell cells if you run dry, and don’t be too proud to buy them. Six of the buggers. Then home.\""
    },
    "sewer_offer": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Point me at it.",
          "next": "sewer_accepted"
        },
        {
          "label": "Maybe later.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Earn? Same way I do — off what nobody else’ll touch.\" He jerks a thumb at the floor. \"That storm drain out on Ironside, the one with the grate kicked off — it drops into the Under. Old sewers. Something’s breeding down there and it’s working its way up toward my vats. Rats. Roaches. Worse.\" He taps the flashlight he gave you. \"You’ve got the light now. Go down, thin ’em out — call it six of the things — and come tell me it’s done. The dark’s the only thing down there that’ll kill you, and you’re carrying the cure.\""
    },
    "sewer_reported": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "TURN_IN",
          "quest_id": "quest_down_the_drain"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "All in a day’s work.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "He hears the count and nods, slow. \"Six. And you walked back up under your own power — that’s the part most don’t manage.\" He counts a few spare cells into your palm along with the pay. \"A dead flashlight’s just a club, and you’re better than a club now. Barely. Keep it fed.\""
    },
    "shop": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "OPEN_SHOP",
          "npcId": "npc_grady"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "(browse the crates)",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Have a look. You break it, you bought it — but most of it’s pre-broken, so relax.\""
    }
  },
